{"resourceIdentifier":"2387","resourceName":"Liugui Afforestation Project","description":"Liugui Afforestation Project (hereafter refer to as “the project”) is located within Liuzhou City, Guigang City, Laibing City, Yulin City, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region of China. 33,000 ha (495,000 Mu )of forest was planted on barren lands in Liuzhou City, Guigang City, Laibing City, Yulin City which used to be poor sustainable ecological environment and karst rocky desertification. The implementation of the project activity has provided 30,251 jobs for local villagers, among which 65 percent are women. \r\n\r\nThe project activity aims to:\r\n-\tSequester greenhouse gas and mitigate climate change;\r\n-\tEnhance biodiversity conservation by increasing the connectivity of forests;\r\n-\tImprove soil and water conservation in the Karst region;\r\n-\tGenerate income and job opportunities for local communities.\r\n\r\nThere is no natural renewal and reforestation before the project, and all sites were covered by the barren hill and degraded lands. The main objective species are China fir, Masson pine and Slash pine which are native species according to the baseline survey.\r\n\r\nThe implementation of the project is expected to reduce the GHG emissions amounting to 26,344,152 tCO2e in 30 years, with an average annual GHG emission removal of 878,138 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":22.333331,"longitude":108.416666},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-08","endExclusive":"2022-08-08","endInclusive":"2022-08-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2387"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Baixin Agricultural Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"(Guangxi) pilot Free Trade Zone, China"},{"type":"string","value":"13917344437"